## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| False positives | Auto-commit only ≥0.8; queue everything else |
| Repeat topic ≠ rejection | Low confidence (0.6), always queued |
| Time decay aggressive | 90-day threshold + lowest confidence (0.5) |
